BT /F2 14 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 56.00 503.89 Td (Recommended manual test order) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 48.00 476.89 Td (1. Check health, then log in as the bootstrapped owner.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 48.00 464.89 Td (2. Create an academic year, term, class level, subject, and section.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 48.00 452.89 Td (3. Add the subject to the class curriculum, then to the section.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 48.00 440.89 Td (4. Create teacher accounts and assignments.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 48.00 428.89 Td (5. Create a student and parent account, create/link a guardian, then enroll the student.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 48.00 416.89 Td (6. Try scoped reads with teacher, parent, and student accounts. Use disposable local records for) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 48.00 404.89 Td (close/end operations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 48.00 385.89 Td (Create the first owner interactively, if not already done: corepack pnpm --filter @schoolerp/api) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 48.00 373.89 Td (bootstrap:owner.) Tj ET
